<task id="to_collaborate_using_outlook_759703" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>To Collaborate Using Outlook</title>
   <shortdesc>Prerequisites</shortdesc>
   <prolog>
      <author type="creator">user-0266f</author>
      <critdates>
         <revised modified="Nov 05, 2018"/>
      </critdates>
       <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>Chatter</keyword>
        <keyword>email</keyword>
        <keyword>Outlook</keyword>
        <keyword>placeholder</keyword>
        <keyword>content</keyword>
        <keyword>version</keyword>
        <indexterm>Chatter</indexterm>
        <indexterm>email</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Outlook</indexterm>
      </keywords>
          <prodinfo>
        <prodname/>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>
            <b>Prerequisites</b>
         </p>
         <p>The X-Author Outlook add-in must have been installed and you are connected.</p>
         <p>
            <b>Steps</b>
         </p>
      </context>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <b>Chatter</b> from the <b>X-Author</b> Chatter ribbon.
Chatter opens in its own window within Outlook and you may need to resize it for optimal viewing.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Select who you want to collaborate within your Chatter feed by clicking one of the icons:</cmd>
            <info>
               <table>
                  <tgroup cols="2">
                     <colspec colname="c1"/>
                     <colspec colname="c2"/>
                     <tbody>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <image href="../attachments/98671234/98671210.jpg" placement="inline" width="16" height="16">
                                       <alt>placeholder</alt>
                                    </image>
                                 </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Your audience will be everyone in your organization with a Chatter account.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <image href="../attachments/98671234/98671208.jpg" placement="inline" width="17" height="16">
                                       <alt>placeholder</alt>
                                    </image>
                                 </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Your audience will be all the members of the group you select.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <image href="../attachments/98671234/98671207.jpg" placement="inline" width="17" height="16">
                                       <alt>placeholder</alt>
                                    </image>
                                 </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Your audience will be the single individual you select.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                     </tbody>
                  </tgroup>
               </table>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd> Select how you want to share content in the feed</cmd>
            <info>
               <fig>
                  <title>98671233</title>
                  <image href="../attachments/98671234/98671233.jpg" width="478" height="225" placement="break">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
            </info>
            <info>
               <table>
                  <tgroup cols="2">
                     <colspec colname="c1"/>
                     <colspec colname="c2"/>
                     <tbody>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Post</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Enter a comment to solicit feedback, while not copying any content from the body of the email or any email attachments.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Selected Content</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Highlight content from the body of your email and it will be included in the feed entry, without any formatting.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Attachments</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>For a single attachment, select whether to Upload as a new version to an existing file or to Upload as a new file. A new version means that it would become the new version to a file you already have in your Chatter &gt; Files.You use the Upload Version dialog box to search for the file stored in Chatter you want to attach as the new version. A new file is added to your Chatter feed and subsequently is available from Chatter &gt; Files.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Message</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Selecting this enables a drop-down list with the following options:.doc - Attaches the email to the feed as a Word file..html - Attaches the email to the feed as anhtmlfile..msg - Packages the email and all attachments into an Outlook .msg file and attaches it to the feed. This file can only be opened with Outlook..rtf - Attaches the email to the feed as a Word file..txt - Attaches the email to the feed as a text file.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                     </tbody>
                  </tgroup>
               </table>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <b>Share</b> to share your content to the Chatter feed.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <b>Refresh</b> to ensure you feed is up to date and that you receive feedback from your colleagues.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
   </taskbody>
</task>